  favouriteDish: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3555452b33a4b34696e02d4dc405a7f, type: 2}
  homeLiking:
    resident: {fileID: 11400000}
    likes: Lit lane
    line: '"A light on the path. I come home late."'
    thanks: '"Light on my path. I came home late and saw every step of it."'
  jobs:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6af8ca180b22423448d6e1e307037eb6, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 336ec86166557214baa58cda9d5a9f91, type: 2}
    text: I read ground the way you read faces. Give me the Tracker's work and every briefing names one more thing out there. Go through once and you'll hear it.
    acceptText: Read it for me.
    waitingText: Go through the portal and come home. The briefing will have something more in it.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e30fedb08146699458d2cc3191255642, type: 2}
    text: Something small takes from the camps and is gone before you turn. A tusse. Track one, and catch it before it slips away.
    acceptText: I'll catch it.
    waitingText: One tusse. They run the moment they see you.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
  sideQuests:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 368885b39fb47ac438073d5978b8c2ab, type: 2}
    text: I walked those cairns once for a man in grey, counting stones. Now I want each to have one more from home, or the way forgets itself. The Lookout Cairn, then the Raven Cairn.
    acceptText: A stone on each.
    waitingText: West, on the knolls. A stone on each cairn.
    askText: The cairns on Westwood's knolls?
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b081c1e8118da03499dab7818ac2ea12, type: 2}
    text: 
    acceptText: I'll do it.
    waitingText: Light Westwood's stone, and the ways run between the lit stones again.
    askText: 
    thanksText: The old ways are open. Touch any lit stone, and it knows the way to the others.
